{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Pushed as Gerrit 3249 (hashtag `rebar-session-6a3fecbb`), commit `6890a0fc05a`.\n\n`make verify` evidence, run in this worktree under its own `.venv`:\n\n- lint + typecheck: clean.\n- Default tier (`not integration and not external`, the gating `ubuntu-latest, py3.13` selection): **20,405 passed, 27 skipped, 0 failed** in 59:57.\n- Integration tier: **1 failed, 202 passed, 3 skipped** in 3:16.\n\nThe single failure is `tests/integration/test_s3_doctor.py::test_git_remote_s3_api_surface_contract`, and it is not this change. Evidence that it is independent rather than merely plausible-looking:\n\n- `git diff origin/main -- tests/integration/test_s3_doctor.py` is empty, so it reproduces on unmodified `main`.\n- This commit touches 4 files — `.gitignore`, `.rebar/criteria_routing.json`, `.rebar/prompts/plan-review-project-net-mechanism.md`, `tests/unit/test_project_net_mechanism_criterion.py`. None is s3-related.\n- The cause is host state: the test skips on `shutil.which(\"git-remote-s3\")` but its body imports the `git_remote_s3` *module*. This host has the binary at `~/.local/bin/git-remote-s3` from a separate install while the module is absent from the worktree venv, so the guard admits a test whose dependency is missing.\n\nThat guard bug already has a ticket, `dominating-effete-bat` (`a54e-4b02`), which I updated with this reproduction. It is deliberately not fixed here: widening this commit's `file_impact` to carry an unrelated test fix would invalidate the current plan-review certificate and force a re-review.\n\nVerify took ~63 minutes rather than the documented 25–30, with two gate daemons running on the host concurrently."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793680380341822357,"uuid":"194556e6-7c4d-41fe-8301-ffe3aa130cc1"}